2026sep Had a peaceful cruise trip with Sai's grace

        Was planning first time cruise with family (spouse, kids) upon recommendation from a Sai devotee.
        Had doubts - sea sickness, weather in ocean, sailing season, what if we fall sick during travel etc etc ...
        However, we left those doubts on Sai and booked 5 days Bahamas cruise via Norwegian Getaway (from Florida Miami).
        A week around our trip, weather in North Atlantic ocean was turbulent. 
        However, south Atlantic was quiet (our sailing point) - as if Sai knew, His children were sailing, so it better be calm .....
        And, september weather was perfect for water - summer clothes were sufficient (no winter clothes needed), 
        and Atlantic was warm for all day water activity. Sai chose the apt sailing dates for us :-)
        We got the best cabin (suite with balcony), caring crew, magnanimous nature view, delicacies/cuisine from around the world ...
        We didn't buy internet pack, but that came as boon - mind was at so much rest, away from social media ...... 
        It was an experience of lifetime .... We returned back safely - with kids already asking, when are we cruising next :-) ....
        Thank you Sai.

2026oct Baba called and gave volunteering opportunity during Dussehra   

        Family (spouse and kids) had left few days back (as children school is at a different place) ... 
        I was alone and missing them ....
        I usually volunteer every week, but as I was feeling low, I felt like taking a mini break from volunteering .....
        However, Sai had different plans for cheering me ......

        Dussehra was on Tuesday Oct 20 ..... On that day, I was driving to work around 8am .....
        I had a meeting at 9. Traffic was unusually high and while I reached midway, temple exit came.
        So, instead of sitting in traffic, I decided to take exit to temple and attend the meeting from there (remotely).
        And thought, that traffic may settle down later.
        I reached temple; had a nice darshan; finished my meeting remotely and was about to leave for office ....
        Suddenly, a temple volunteer came running to me, requesting for help 
        in temple kitchen (since there was lot of event cooking, and less volunteers were available in morning).
        I took that as an indication from Sai and went to kitchen to help ....
        By 1pm, we finished majority of cooking and then with lot of satisfaction (from service), went to office .....
        Office went very smooth that day ...... Some major technical issues got resolved ....
        In the evening, had a 2nd visit to temple .... And then, returned home peacefully, thanking Sai for allowing His service .... 

        How can Baba leave his children to feel low and alone .... He is behind us, always and everywhere ... Om Sairam


        

        
